<doc id="64216" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=64216" title="20th Century Fox">
20th Century Fox

20th Century Studios iku salah siji &lt;a href="studio%20filem"&gt;studio filem&lt;/a&gt; utama, dumunung ing &lt;a href="Century%20City%2C%20Los%20Angeles"&gt;Century Fox&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, persis ing sisih kuloné &lt;a href="Beverly%20Hills"&gt;Beverly Hills&lt;/a&gt;. Studio iki minangka &lt;a href="anak%20parusahan"&gt;anak parusahan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="News%20Corporation"&gt;News Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, konglomerat médhia sing dikuwasani déning &lt;a href="Rupert%20Murdoch"&gt;Rupert Murdoch&lt;/a&gt;.
Parusahan iki minangka asil saka panggabungan loro parusahan, &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox%20Corporation"&gt;20th Century Fox Corporation&lt;/a&gt; diadegaké déning &lt;a href="Wilhelm%20Fried"&gt;William Fox&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1915"&gt;1915&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Twentieth%20Century%20Pictures"&gt;Twentieth Century Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, diwiwiti taun &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Darryl%20F.%20Zanuck"&gt;Darryl F. Zanuck&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Joseph%20Schenck"&gt;Joseph Schenck&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raymond%20Griffith"&gt;Raymond Griffith&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ESPIAS%20CON%20DISFRAZ"&gt;ESPIAS CON DISFRAZ&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Distribusi televisi</h2>
Distribusi televisi.
&lt;a href="20th%20Television"&gt;20th Television&lt;/a&gt; mligi kanggo divisi distributor, sauntara iku &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox%20Television"&gt;20th Century Fox Television&lt;/a&gt; dikhususakaé kanggo studio.
<h2>Logo lan musik khas</h2>
Logo lan musik khas.
Logo 20th Century Pictures, didesain déning Emil Kosa, Jr, wujud 3 baris tembung, "20th", "CENTURY", lan "PICTURES Inc", sing diwangun saka cadhas utawa logam kanthi tembung kang "ditumpuk-tumpuk", semono uga diukir larikan mbaka larikan. Tembung "20th" ukuran gedhé lan sisané ukuran cilik. Panggung bunder kaya struktur dumunung ing ngisor tumpukan tembung lan ana sotoran &lt;a href="lampu"&gt;lampu&lt;/a&gt;. Logo 20th Century Fox, diluncuraké &lt;a href="8%20November"&gt;8 November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1935"&gt;1935&lt;/a&gt;, bebarengan karo 20th Century Pictures, kanthi jeneng "FOX" nggantèkaké tembung "PICTURES Inc".
Musik khas 20th Century Fox dirancang déning Alfred Newman.
