<doc id="64292" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=64292" title="Bambi">
Bambi

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Tokoh mligi &lt;a href="kidang"&gt;kidang&lt;/a&gt; abuntut putih (&lt;a href="Odocoileus%20virginianus"&gt;Odocoileus virginianus&lt;/a&gt;) aran Bambi, wong tuwané (sang bapak aran Great Prince of the Forest, lan sang ibu ora disebutaké jenengé), kanca-kanca Bambi kaya ta &lt;a href="Thumper%20%28Bambi%29"&gt;Thumper&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="truw%C3%A8lu"&gt;truwèlu&lt;/a&gt; irung jambon), Flower (&lt;a href="sigung"&gt;sigung&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Faline"&gt;Faline&lt;/a&gt;, kanca mangsa cilikan sisan pasangané img dina mburi. Sajeroning filem, Disney ngowahi paraga Bambi dadi kidang abuntut putih. Alesané, "kidang roe" ora ana ing Amérika Sarékat, lan wong Amérika luwih kenal kidang abuntut putih. Film iki olèh 3 nominasi &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggo tata swara paling apik, lagu pang apik kanggo "Love Is a Song", lan musik asli paling apik.
Paraga: Bobby Stewart, Donnie Dunagan, Hardie Albright, John Sutherland, Paula Winslowe, Peter Behn, Tim Davis, Sam Edwards, Will Wright, Cammie King, Ann Gillis, Fred Shields, lan Stan Alexander mèlu ngisi swara filem iki. Sekuel filem iki, &lt;a href="Bambi%20II"&gt;Bambi II&lt;/a&gt;, dirilis ing taun 2006.
Sasi Juni 2008, &lt;a href="American%20Film%20Institute"&gt;American Film Institute&lt;/a&gt; mbiwara "10 Top 10" kang isi 10 filem paling apik Amérika antarané 10 genre filem "klasik". Peringkat mau asal saka survé 1.500 wong saka kalangan komunitas kreatif. Bambi ana ing peringkat katelu sajeroning genre animasi.
