Miss Universe 2010

Miss Universe 2010 iku kontès &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe"&gt;Miss Universe&lt;/a&gt; angka 59 kang dianakaké ing Mandalay Bay Resorts and Casino ing &lt;a href="Las%20Vegas"&gt;Las Vegas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nevada"&gt;Nevada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="USA"&gt;USA&lt;/a&gt; tanggal 23 Agustus 2010. 83 peserta saka manéka nagara ngrebutaké makutha (waca: gelar) Miss Universe. &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202009"&gt;Miss Universe 2009&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Stefan%C3%ADa%20Fern%C3%A1ndez"&gt;Stefanía Fernández&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Venezuela"&gt;Venezuela&lt;/a&gt; masang makutha &lt;a href="Jimena%20Navarrete"&gt;Jimena Navarrete&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Meksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt; kang menangaké ajang Miss Universe 2010. Miss Universe 2010 digiyaraké kanthi langsung déning &lt;a href="NBC"&gt;NBC&lt;/a&gt; lan Telemundo, déné ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; digiyaraké déning &lt;a href="Indosiar"&gt;Indosiar&lt;/a&gt;. Pranatacara acara iki ya iku Bret Michaels lan Natalie Morales.
